--- AGENTS test section ---
## Test

Unit tests are **inline** inside `src/` files (e.g. `src/config.rs`); integration tests live in `tests/cli.rs` and inject a temporary `HOME`, so the real `~/.tam` is never touched (`tests/` is only excluded from packaging in `Cargo.toml`).

```bash
14:- **Soft deletes**: Both `project` and `task` tables have an `is_deleted` field. Deletion updates `is_deleted = 1`, preserving historical data. Never run `DELETE FROM` directly. Re-adding a deleted project's name **restores** that project (`project add` reports `restored`); an active duplicate still fails with `already exists`.
44:| `tam project del <name>` | Delete a project (soft delete); refused while it has active task(s), reporting the count | `tam p d` |
53:| `tam task list [--status <todo\|in-progress\|done>]` | List tasks in the current project, optionally filtered by status | `tam t l` |
